  <item>
    <title>叁丨为·以性别视角重审归路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645bedd82b428eafd027a72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6645bedd82b428eafd027a72</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 08:07:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在传统叙事中，母亲是伟大的无私的，但真的有人在意过，除了母亲这个身份，她还是谁呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>从自身出发，我们来简单聊聊女性的身份及在这些身份中的处境！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> “听见她说”由活动主题演变为女性文化品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> “母亲节”是怎么建立起来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> &nbsp;女性无论以什么身份，都是一种处境，作为他者存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 生育是种族需要绵续，还是人需要绵续？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 人啊 ！就应该什么年龄该干什么事！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 伴随女性消失的不仅是性命，还有姓名！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> </span><a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/IMSH3Q7U0552ZFRL.html" data-url="https://www.163.com/dy/article/IMSH3Q7U0552ZFRL.html"><span>转移话题 猎巫....还有多少手段？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 子宫真的由我吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 新问题还是旧问题 任重而道远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a>“那么，我该去向哪里呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;终点越来越远</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;归家之路比想象中还要漫长</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从这里出发，我该去向哪里呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;归路如此漫长</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我只能两手空空，回到起点</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从东京出发，我究竟该归向何处呢？”</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>水田宗子《归路》——从东京出发</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期书单：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/348543" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/348543"><span>[日]上野千鹤子</span></a><span>《女性的思想》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4522533" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4522533"><span>费孝通</span></a><span>《生育制度》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617342" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617342"><span>[以]奥娜·多纳特</span></a><span>《成为母亲的选择》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617491" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617491"><span>[荷]米尼克•希珀</span></a><span>《乐园之丘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>张春酷酷酷-你也有前夫</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654e03b0aa96f6e64268da7c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654e03b0aa96f6e64268da7c"><span>1</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a4bbb0b5e4856c708f68fb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a4bbb0b5e4856c708f68fb"><span>2</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————我们长期招募读书嘉宾，欢迎私信！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqhWeLvJysrW8YFbMglJn4Sgj6dL.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljmSE6B-eAgDa7vUJTyP9-uCIxnH.m4a" length="57598636" type="audio/mp4"/>
