  <item>
    <title>贰丨寻· 四月无意义的漫谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6637a30f4b7d3b5d3b2f5f08</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6637a30f4b7d3b5d3b2f5f08</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 May 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>Can February March? &nbsp;No, but April May.</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVDCeFzbf6krFFeDHHWtRAi0Tn5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>四月可能适合无意义，欢迎去五月探索可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期毫无逻辑的把四月碎碎念，就当做给阴雨连绵的四月画个句号：毕竟生活总在变，我们要做的就是不断适应！fight for myself！</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 十万个为什么与无意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 聆听四月的风雨声&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 爬山虎的故事与创作的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 寻求反馈与窥探心灵的警报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 汉密尔顿：I am not throwing away my shot！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 这就是我与世界链接的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 契诃夫说：我决不食言，我只懒到五月份。从 6 月 1 日起我就坐下来写作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 未来几期的小小打算</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期书单：林棹《潮汐图》 黎紫书《流俗地》 焦典《孔雀菩提》 冈本加乃子《老妓抄》 奥娜·多纳特《成为母亲的选择》 契诃夫《海鸥》《装在套子里的人》 保罗奥斯特《布鲁克林的荒唐事》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>影视剧：《蜡笔小新》《楚门的世界》《荼蘼》《我可能不会爱你》</span><a href="【【音乐剧】汉密尔顿Hamilton官摄（完整超清）】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Da411S7pq/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=5eb65597d61aec17b3b36af9ae813fd1" data-url="【【音乐剧】汉密尔顿Hamilton官摄（完整超清）】 https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Da411S7pq/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=5eb65597d61aec17b3b36af9ae813fd1"><span>《汉密尔顿》</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>我们长期招募读书嘉宾，欢迎私信！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqhWeLvJysrW8YFbMglJn4Sgj6dL.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkM2TCZCgpM2bFUPObcbFVDongXd.m4a" length="46434121" type="audio/mp4"/>
